### LOGOUT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### LOBBIES #####

#### GET LOBBIES
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lobbies HTTP/1.1
Cookie: AuthCookie={{token}}
#### GET LOBBIES SORTED
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lobbies?sort=desc HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
#### GET LOBBIES SORTED ASC
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lobbies?sort=asc HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
#### GET ONLY 2 LOBBIES
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lobbies?limit=2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
#### GET LOBBIES SKIPPING FIRST 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lobbies?limit=2&skip=2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
#### GET LOBBIES WHERE NAME CONTAINS 
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lobbies?contains=ta HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

#### GET LOBBY BY ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lobbies/48 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### CREATE LOBBY 
POST http://localhost:8080/api/lobby HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Lobby Teste",
  "description": "Lobby para testes",
  "maxPlayers": 2,
  "maxRounds": 5,
  "timeoutSeconds": 30
}

### JOIN LOBBY
POST http://localhost:8080/api/lobbies/4/join HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### LEAVE LOBBY
POST http://localhost:8080/api/lobbies/15/leave HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### USERS #####

### GET USER BY ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### GET USERS BY NAME (Alice)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users?name=Alice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### GET ALL USERS
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### GET USERS CONTAINING "ob"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users?contains=ob
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET USERS ORDERED BY NAME ASC
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users?sort=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET USERS ORDERED BY NAME DESC  
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users?sort=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET ONLY 2 USERS
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users?limit=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET USERS SKIPPING FIRST 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users?skip=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### COMBINATION: Contains + Sort + Limit
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users?contains=ob&sort=asc&limit=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### GET MATCH BY ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/matches/15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### LIST ROUNDS BY MATCH ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/matches/1/rounds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### LIST CURRENT ROUND BY MATCH ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/matches/1/rounds/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET ROUND DETAILS BY ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/matches/1/rounds/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET CURRENT TURN BY MATCH ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/matches/1/turns/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET HAND HISTORY BY MATCH ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/matches/1/hands
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET TIMELINE EVENTS BY MATCH ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/matches/1/timeline
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ROLL DICE (First Roll)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/matches/1/turns/current/roll
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

